{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And they shall keep apart.</b> Like והזרתם, and it is from the nifal paradigm, and the meaning is: they shall distance and separate themselves, from the root of Nazirite [נזיר]." "<b>And they shall not profane.</b> It draws itself and another after it, and likewise is ולא יחללו אתם את שם קדשי [and they shall not profane My holy name], and ולא יחללו — that which they consecrate to Me." "And the meaning of <b>I am YHWH.</b> is: holy."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:11:38.770404312Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}